# path: /v1/chat/completions
# base-url: https://api.meta.ai   (export META_BASE_URL=https://api.meta.ai ; the path above carries /v1)
# content-type: json
# model: muse-spark-1.3-contributor   (same Spark model and tier as spark-sheet)
# input: the character cutout image (PNG/JPEG, <= 512 px long side, the image the sheet call saw) -> {{INPUT_MIME}}/{{INPUT_B64}}
# added 2026-11-04 (T29): MetaApi.choreograph = ChatRequest.choreograph(model, sheet, image). The text part is
