#   lines are the generic English fallback); a live call carries the character's own sheet. Without an image the
#   message has the text part only.
# shape: response_format json_schema "Choreographies", strict, every object additionalProperties:false with all its
#   properties required; keys are arrays of objects of numbers. Bounds live in the prompt text, not in the schema;
#   core/emote ChoreographyRules.sanitize enforces them on whatever comes back.
# unverified: not probed yet (T30 probes it live): whether strict:true accepts five nested objects of arrays of objects,
#   whether 4096 max_completion_tokens is enough with reasoning_effort low, latency and cost.
# generated from the code (core/meta MetaDtos.kt); RequestShapeTest checks this body against it.
